OL,3,AMushroom killer must stay in jail for
OL,4,A'truly dreadful' crime, prosecutors
OL,5,Atell appeal court
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Australian court has wrapped up the
OL,8,Fsecond and last day of an appeal
OL,9,Fhearing by so-called mushroom murderer
OL,10,FErin Patterson and a decision could
OL,11,Ftake several weeks or months
OL,13,FThe 51-year-old was jailed for life
OL,14,Flast year after three of her relatives
OL,15,Fwere killed and another left severely
OL,16,Funwell after eating a lunch laced with
OL,17,Fpoisonous mushrooms - here's a
OL,18,Frefresher on the trial
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
