OL,3,AMushroom killer must stay in jail for
OL,4,A'truly dreadful' crime, prosecutors
OL,5,Atell appeal court
OL,6,
OL,7,FPatterson's lawyers argued at
OL,8,Fyesterday's hearing that an error which
OL,9,Fsaw the jury accidentally stay in the
OL,10,Fsame hotel as some prosecutors and a
OL,11,Fkey witness was "catastrophic" for the
OL,12,Fintegrity of the trial - and that
OL,13,Fseveral pieces of evidence were misused
